            "textLines": [
              "Here is a variant-first button primitive that keeps the public API on the sealed variant instead of one-off colors or radii.",
              "",
              "```kotlin",
              "sealed interface OpenCodeButtonVariant {",
              "    data class FullWidthText(val title: String) : OpenCodeButtonVariant",
              "    data class CompactText(val title: String) : OpenCodeButtonVariant",
              "    data class IconSquare(",
              "        val imageVector: ImageVector,",
              "        val contentDescription: String? = null,",
              "    ) : OpenCodeButtonVariant",
              "}",
              "",
              "@Composable",
              "fun OpenCodeButton(",
              "    variant: OpenCodeButtonVariant,",
              "    onClick: () -> Unit,",
              "    contrast: OpenCodeButtonContrast,",
              "    size: OpenCodeButtonSize,",
              ")",
              "```",
              "",
              "Should this also expose an IconCircle variant, or keep the public set to these three?"
            ]
          }
        ]
